{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46187","headline":"山居诗二十四首 一 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"休话諠譁事事难，山翁只合住深山。\n数声清磬是非外，一个闲人天地间。\n绿圃空阶云冉冉，异禽灵草水潺潺。\n无人与向羣儒说，岩桂枝高亦好扳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}